- Random seeds recorded for reproducibility.
- Temperature of attacker (for PAIR) fixed or set as part of strength definition.

Blocking:
- Block by prompt (same prompt across all 24×... conditions) → repeated measures; prompt as random effect.
- Dataset as a blocking/replication factor (fixed or random at analysis level).
- Counterbalancing/randomization of order of conditions to avoid sequence/order effects; run order randomized per prompt or per cell.

